WEBVTT

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.116
Before a navigator sets off anywhere, they
do one small thing first.

00:00:11.116 --> 00:00:15.404
They take their bearings: where am I
standing, right now?

00:00:16.604 --> 00:00:22.090
That's what we're going to do together.
Only, this time, the map is inside you.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.252
Keep a pen and paper close.

00:00:25.252 --> 00:00:29.191
You can pause the video at any point to
write your answers down,

00:00:29.191 --> 00:00:31.714
and you can always come back to it later.

00:00:32.914 --> 00:00:36.369
Turn your imagination right up, be honest,

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.948
and always go with your very first
impression.

00:00:39.948 --> 00:00:42.782
Don't worry, there are no wrong answers
here.

00:00:42.782 --> 00:00:47.758
Only symbols hiding deep in your mind, and
at the end, I'll help you read them.

00:00:48.958 --> 00:00:50.604
Ready? Let's go.

00:00:53.104 --> 00:00:57.701
Imagine you're standing in the middle of a
vast, beautiful desert.

00:00:59.201 --> 00:01:02.855
Your eyes rest on the soft curves of the
dunes.

00:01:02.855 --> 00:01:05.732
Near and far, there's nothing at all…

00:01:06.732 --> 00:01:09.736
…except a cube, which catches your eye.

00:01:11.236 --> 00:01:15.442
Here's your first task. Tell me, what is
this cube like?

00:01:16.442 --> 00:01:22.006
What colour is it? How big? What is it
made of? Where exactly is it?

00:01:23.006 --> 00:01:27.682
What are its edges like? And its surface?
Have a really good look.

00:01:28.482 --> 00:01:38.682
[Pause and write it down]

00:01:38.882 --> 00:01:41.650
Not long after, you discover a ladder.

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:48.571
What is this ladder like? What's it made
of? Is it a single ladder, or a stepladder?

00:01:49.571 --> 00:01:51.204
Does it look old, or new?

00:01:51.204 --> 00:01:55.840
Does it stand up on its own, or does it
have to lean against something?

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:58.956
Would you dare to step onto it?

00:02:00.156 --> 00:02:04.857
If, in the pictures in your head, you
reach out and touch these things,

00:02:04.857 --> 00:02:08.829
that's fine too. Let your imaginary self
move around freely.

00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:18.829
[Pause and write it down]

00:02:19.029 --> 00:02:23.470
Then, all of a sudden, you hear a growl
from behind the nearest dune.

00:02:24.470 --> 00:02:28.336
A lion appears, and it's quite clear it's
about to attack.

00:02:29.336 --> 00:02:31.138
Quick, what do you do?

00:02:31.938 --> 00:02:40.138
[Pause and write it down]

00:02:40.338 --> 00:02:43.656
Written it down? Good. Then here's the
good news.

00:02:44.656 --> 00:02:49.715
Maybe it's the heat, maybe something else,
but before anything can happen,

00:02:49.715 --> 00:02:54.295
the lion simply dissolves into thin air.
You must have imagined it.

00:02:56.295 --> 00:02:59.534
Carry on, because soon you'll come across
a road.

00:03:00.534 --> 00:03:05.602
Use your mind's eye again. What is this
road like? Take a good look.

00:03:06.602 --> 00:03:11.856
Is it straight, or does it wind? Does it
look as if people walk it often?

00:03:11.856 --> 00:03:13.367
What might it be for?

00:03:14.367 --> 00:03:17.450
Is it paved? Notice everything.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:27.450
[Pause and write it down]

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:28.833
Set off along it.

00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:33.841
And once you have, before long you'll hear
gulls crying in the distance…

00:03:34.841 --> 00:03:38.080
…and it doesn't take much more before you
come out at the sea.

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:44.021
Take a deep breath, and look around. Write
down what you see.

00:03:45.021 --> 00:03:51.020
What's the weather like? What's the water
like: calm and quiet, or rough?

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:52.335
Clear, or murky?

00:03:53.335 --> 00:03:57.123
And the shore: is it sand, pebbles, or
rock?

00:03:58.123 --> 00:04:00.630
Let yourself notice everything.

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:11.630
[Pause and write it down]

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:16.036
In the distance, you spot a house. You set
off towards it…

00:04:17.036 --> 00:04:22.287
…but then you notice a sign, too. Hmm. Is
there anything written on it?

00:04:23.487 --> 00:04:27.196
If there isn't, let it be. Just keep
walking.

00:04:28.696 --> 00:04:33.058
Start looking at the house, because you
can make out more and more of it.

00:04:34.058 --> 00:04:39.387
Tell me, what is it like? What is it built
from? How does it make you feel?

00:04:40.387 --> 00:04:44.515
Does anyone live there? Gather up
everything that comes to you.

00:04:45.315 --> 00:04:55.515
[Pause and write it down]

00:04:55.715 --> 00:04:59.842
And finally, just before you reach the
house, a horse appears.

00:05:01.042 --> 00:05:04.751
What is it like? What does it do when it
sees you?

00:05:05.751 --> 00:05:09.461
And what does it do after that? Write
everything down.

00:05:10.261 --> 00:05:19.461
[Pause and write it down]

00:05:19.661 --> 00:05:23.135
And that's it, that was the whole game.
How was it?

00:05:24.635 --> 00:05:29.703
Look at what's on your page. That's where
you're standing right now: your bearings.

00:05:31.203 --> 00:05:35.644
And from here, a whole journey opens up,
if you'd like to take it.

00:05:37.144 --> 00:05:40.052
Your key is waiting for you just below
this video.

00:05:40.052 --> 00:05:42.786
Come and see what your symbols are telling
you.
